        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong> 🕸️ Step into the shadows of a crumbling realm where a lone <strong>Dark Knight</strong> rises from the depths of despair to face the horrors that dwell beneath. In this grim dungeon-crawling action RPG, you take control of a cursed warrior whose only path to redemption lies through blood, steel, and arcane fire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌑 <strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Combat</strong>: Fight grotesque enemies using devastating melee combos, dark magic, and tactical dodges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Dungeon Exploration</strong>: Traverse haunted catacombs, ancient crypts, and mysterious chambers. Each room holds secrets… or death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Evolve</strong>: Unlock powerful skills, collect enchanted gear, and forge legendary weapons to survive deeper into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal Progression System</strong>: Clear zones and activate mystical portals to return, recover, and venture further into darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong>: Pixel art meets gothic horror, blending nostalgia with atmospheric dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong> 🕸️ Step into the shadows of a crumbling realm where a lone <strong>Dark Knight</strong> rises from the depths of despair to face the horrors that dwell beneath. In this grim dungeon-crawling action RPG, you take control of a cursed warrior whose only path to redemption lies through blood, steel, and arcane fire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌑 <strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Combat</strong>: Fight grotesque enemies using devastating melee combos, dark magic, and tactical dodges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Dungeon Exploration</strong>: Traverse haunted catacombs, ancient crypts, and mysterious chambers. Each room holds secrets… or death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Evolve</strong>: Unlock powerful skills, collect enchanted gear, and forge legendary weapons to survive deeper into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal Progression System</strong>: Clear zones and activate mystical portals to return, recover, and venture further into darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong>: Pixel art meets gothic horror, blending nostalgia with atmospheric dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
